3. TNM stage groupings (components/kaplan-meier/tnm-wiley-staging-data.ts)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Stage groupings according to: Wittekind C (ed.). TNM Klassifikation maligner
Tumoren, 9. Auflage (German edition of the UICC TNM Classification of Malignant
Tumours). Wiley-VCH, 2025.


4. OncoBox validation schemas and sample files
----------------------------------------------
data/oncobox-schemas/*.xsd, public/oncobox-samples/*.xml and the file derived
from them, components/kaplan-meier/oncobox/codes.generated.ts
Source: OnkoZert GmbH, https://www.xml-oncobox.de
The sample files do not contain real patient data
(see public/oncobox-samples/SOURCE.md).


5. oBDS schema (public/oBDS_v3.0.5.xsd.xml)
-------------------------------------------
Onkologischer Basisdatensatz (oBDS, German basic oncology data set)
version 3.0.5, Plattform § 65c / https://basisdatensatz.de


6. Sample data sets METABRIC and TCGA
-------------------------------------
public/sample-metabric.csv, public/sample-tcga.csv: processed clinical data
obtained via cBioPortal (https://www.cbioportal.org). The diagnosis data have
been supplemented with synthetic values.

  METABRIC: Curtis C et al. Nature 2012;486:346–352.
            Pereira B et al. Nat Commun 2016;7:11479.
  TCGA:     The results shown here are in whole or part based upon data
            generated by the TCGA Research Network: https://www.cancer.gov/tcga
            Hoadley KA et al. Cell 2018;173:291–304.
            Liu J et al. Cell 2018;173:400–416 (TCGA-CDR).
  cBioPortal: Cerami E et al. Cancer Discov 2012;2:401–404.
              Gao J et al. Sci Signal 2013;6:pl1.


7. ICD-10-GM (data/icd10-codes.json)
------------------------------------
List of three-character ICD-10-GM codes. Published by the German Federal
Institute for Drugs and Medical Devices (Bundesinstitut für Arzneimittel und
Medizinprodukte, BfArM).
